    "custom_liquid_testimonials_mobile": {
      "type": "custom-liquid",
      "settings": {
        "custom_liquid": "<style>\n.thea-testimonials-wrap{padding:36px 20px;text-align:center;}\n.thea-testimonials-wrap h2{font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-size:3rem;margin-bottom:24px;}\n.thea-grid{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap;}\n.thea-grid .thea-card{max-width:220px;}\n.thea-marquee-wrap{display:none;overflow:hidden;}\n.thea-marquee-track{display:flex;width:max-content;animation:theaMarqueeScroll 28s linear infinite;}\n.thea-marquee-track:hover{animation-play-state:paused;}\n.thea-card{background:transparent;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;}\n.thea-card .stars{color:#2D3A2F;font-size:2rem;letter-spacing:2px;margin-bottom:10px;}\n.thea-card .name{font-family:var(--font-heading-family);font-size:2rem;margin-bottom:12px;}\n.thea-card .quote{font-size:1.2rem;line-height:1.7rem;}\n@media screen and (max-width: 749px){\n  .thea-grid{display:none;}\n  .thea-marquee-wrap{display:block;}\n  .thea-marquee-track .thea-card{flex:0 0 auto;width:260px;margin-right:40px;}\n}\n@keyframes theaMarqueeScroll{\n  from{transform:translateX(0);}\n  to{transform:translateX(-50%);}\n}\n</style>\n<div class=\"thea-testimonials-wrap\">\n  <h2>What People Are Saying</h2>\n  <div class=\"thea-grid\">\n    <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Kelly Mason</div><div class=\"quote\">Tastes as good as it smells.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Aditi</div><div class=\"quote\">Subtle, not overpowering but still strong and tasty.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Chris</div><div class=\"quote\">Clean and natural, definitely something I'd have again. Loved the meditation.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mowaimin</div><div class=\"quote\">Without sugar the taste is nice, as I am a tea lover.</div></div>\n    <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mani</div><div class=\"quote\">So smooth, subtle, fresh and clean.</div></div>\n  </div>\n  <div class=\"thea-marquee-wrap\">\n    <div class=\"thea-marquee-track\">\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Kelly Mason</div><div class=\"quote\">Tastes as good as it smells.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Aditi</div><div class=\"quote\">Subtle, not overpowering but still strong and tasty.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Chris</div><div class=\"quote\">Clean and natural, definitely something I'd have again. Loved the meditation.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mowaimin</div><div class=\"quote\">Without sugar the taste is nice, as I am a tea lover.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mani</div><div class=\"quote\">So smooth, subtle, fresh and clean.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Kelly Mason</div><div class=\"quote\">Tastes as good as it smells.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Aditi</div><div class=\"quote\">Subtle, not overpowering but still strong and tasty.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Chris</div><div class=\"quote\">Clean and natural, definitely something I'd have again. Loved the meditation.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mowaimin</div><div class=\"quote\">Without sugar the taste is nice, as I am a tea lover.</div></div>\n      <div class=\"thea-card\"><div class=\"stars\">\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605</div><div class=\"name\">Mani</div><div class=\"quote\">So smooth, subtle, fresh and clean.</div></div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>",
